{"articleNo":"161622","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=161622&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"학내 전용주차구역 이용안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.11.14","hit":"2511","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">「</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">장애인</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">？</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">노인</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">？</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">임산부 등의 편의증진보장에 관한 법률</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">「</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">공공기관 에너지 이용합리화 추진지침</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">」</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에 의해&nbsp; 의무적으로 학내 주차장에 장애인 및 경차전용구역을 운영하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">경차차량이 전용주차구역에 주차하지 않고 일반주차구역에 주차함으로써 일반차량이용자의 불편함이 많이 발생되고 있는 실정입니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#0055ff\">경차 및 장애인차량은 필히 전용주차구역을 이용</font>하여 주시기 바라며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">원활한 주차장 이용을 위해 <font color=\"#0055ff\">서로를 배려하는 주차문화 확립에 적극 </font><font color=\"#0055ff\">동참하여 주시기 바랍니다</font></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시설안전과</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
